.\" Distro-authored man page for the Fedora pidp8i package.
.\" Candidate for upstreaming to the PiDP-8/I project.
.TH PIDP8I-SIM-NLS 1 "November 21, 2026" "PiDP-8/I" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pidp8i-sim-nls \- PiDP-8/I simulator with the lamp simulator off
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pidp8i-sim-nls
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pidp8i-sim-nls
is a hard link to
.BR pidp8i-sim (1)
that forces NLS mode: the incandescent lamp simulator (ILS) is
disabled, so the panel LEDs simply show the lamp bits instead of the
simulated bulb glow and decay. Everything else, including the
requirement for real GPIO panel hardware, is as described in
.BR pidp8i-sim (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pidp8i-sim (1),
.BR pidp8i (1)
